{
  "about": "reporterFollow (src/lib/reporterWait.ts) and reporter_follow (src-tauri/src/inbox/workstreams.rs). `events` is the audit, oldest first. `comments` (ticket comments with author and at) and `me` (the person's own account) are not read yet: they are in the input so a rule that ends the wait on a newer reporter comment can be added to the cases. `expect` is waiting (the since time, or null), and changed (the wait ended because the ticket changed and the person has not chosen since).",
